    text: "@scene_meta_network_history_inconsistency: Chapter 055 calls the Shattered Mind/Lunar connection the network's \"first, hard-won extension\" despite multiple previously established Spire/network interventions."
  - line: 54
    type: narration
    text: "This may refer narrowly to the first newly linked extension created by Kyh/Claude, but that limitation is not explicitly stated, so the wording remains a network-history terminology inconsistency."
